#: manual/index.md:104
msgid "mare_mark is pre-1.0. The versioned contracts are the protocol vocabulary `mmkp_1`, the JSONL artifacts `mmka_1`, the Plot IR schema `mmks_1` and the GEMM tuning configuration `mmkts_1`; readers reject other versions. Timing thresholds, candidate enumeration, HTML styling and private layouts are not compatibility promises. Each design page ends with the package's boundaries."
msgstr ""

